### Session 04 assignment · cloud vs laptop, side by side
### Terminal A:  dotnet run                                                    → cloud on 5080
### Terminal B:  dotnet run --AI:Provider=Ollama --urls http://localhost:5081  → laptop on 5081
### Then click "Send Request" above each block (VS / Rider / VS Code REST Client)
@cloud = http://localhost:5080
@local = http://localhost:5081

### Which provider and model is each one running?
GET {{cloud}}/

###
GET {{local}}/

### Same question, cloud
POST {{cloud}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "In two sentences: what is the difference between a record and a class in C#?" }

### Same question, laptop (send it twice: the first call is the cold one)
POST {{local}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "In two sentences: what is the difference between a record and a class in C#?" }

### Same ticket, cloud
POST {{cloud}}/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "UPI payment failed but the money was deducted from my bank account!!" }

### Same ticket, laptop
POST {{local}}/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "UPI payment failed but the money was deducted from my bank account!!" }

### STRETCH S1 · both answers in one request (after you add /compare)
POST {{cloud}}/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "What is dependency injection, in one sentence?" }
